    <p>Sarah Esther (Gurtner) Tostevin, wife to local newspaper owner/co-editor Edwin Dodge Tostevin, authored the book <strong><u>Mantani: A History of Mandan and Morton County, 1738-1964</u></strong> based largely on accounts reported in <strong><em>The Mandan Pioneer</em></strong> and other local newspapers.</p>

    <p>The hardcopy book was published in 1964 by the Mandan Chamber of Commerce.</p>

    <p>With the Tostevin family's permission, its electronic copy is provided via the link above for viewing or downloading for private, NON-COMMERCIAL use. If additional rights are desired, the Mandan Historical Society will gladly place the party in touch with the Tostevin family member(s).</p>
